<section id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title" class="relative bg-cream-deep py-24 sm:py-32"><div aria-hidden="true" class="scallop-wave pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 z-10 scallop-up bottom-[calc(100%-1px)] text-cream-deep"></div><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 px-5 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-16"><div class="lg:sticky lg:top-32 lg:self-start"><div class="relative max-w-3xl"><h2 id="faq-title" class="relative inline-block font-heading text-[clamp(2.75rem,7.2vw,6.25rem)] leading-[0.92] tracking-[-0.005em]"><span class="reveal block" style="--reveal-delay:0ms">Questions?</span><span class="reveal block" style="--reveal-delay:140ms">Answers.</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none inline-grid shrink-0 select-none place-items-center reveal-pop absolute -top-9 size-20 -rotate-12 text-[0.95rem] [--reveal-delay:320ms] motion-safe:animate-float sm:-top-10 sm:size-24 sm:text-lg -left-4 sm:-left-10"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="block absolute inset-0 size-full drop-shadow-[0_3px_0_rgba(60,13,37,0.25)] text-lavender"><path d="M100 50 L90.5 56.4 L97.6 65.5 L86.5 68.6 L90.5 79.4 L79 79 L79.4 90.5 L68.6 86.5 L65.5 97.6 L56.4 90.5 L50 100 L43.6 90.5 L34.5 97.6 L31.4 86.5 L20.6 90.5 L21 79 L9.5 79.4 L13.5 68.6 L2.4 65.5 L9.5 56.4 L0 50 L9.5 43.6 L2.4 34.5 L13.5 31.4 L9.5 20.6 L21 21 L20.6 9.5 L31.4 13.5 L34.5 2.4 L43.6 9.5 L50 0 L56.4 9.5 L65.5 2.4 L68.6 13.5 L79.4 9.5 L79 21 L90.5 20.6 L86.5 31.4 L97.6 34.5 L90.5 43.6Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><span class="relative px-2 text-center font-heading leading-[0.95] tracking-wide text-plum">FAQ</span></span></h2></div><div class="group reveal-pop mt-10 rounded-[2rem] border-2 border-plum bg-butter p-6 shadow-[0_5px_0_0_var(--color-plum)] [--reveal-delay:300ms]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-circle-question size-8 text-plum transition-transform duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1)] group-hover:-rotate-12 group-hover:scale-125" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z"></path><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg><p class="mt-3 font-heading text-2xl leading-tight text-plum">Still wondering about something?</p><p class="mt-2 text-plum/80">Send us your question and a real human will reply within one business day.</p><a href="#contact" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border-2 font-heading tracking-wide transition-[translate,box-shadow,background-color] duration-200 ease-out hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-1 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-60 border-plum bg-cream text-plum shadow-[0_5px_0_0_var(--color-plum)] hover:shadow-[0_7px_0_0_var(--color-plum)] active:shadow-[0_1px_0_0_var(--color-plum)] h-10 px-4 text-base mt-5">Ask us anything</a></div></div><ul class="space-y-4"><li class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay:0ms"><div class="rounded-[1.75rem] border-2 border-plum transition-[background-color,box-shadow] duration-300 bg-cream shadow-[0_5px_0_0_var(--color-plum)]"><h3><button id="faq-trigger-0" type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faq-panel-0" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="font-heading text-[1.4rem] leading-tight text-plum sm:text-2xl">How long does a typical project take?</span><span class="grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-plum text-plum transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-butter bg-butter"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-5 transition-transform duration-300 rotate-45" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="faq-panel-0" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-0" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[1fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-6 pb-6 leading-relaxed text-plum/80">Most brand identities take four to six weeks and most websites six to ten. Monthly plans start within a week of signing. You&#x27;ll get a week-by-week timeline before any work begins.</p></div></div></div></li><li class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay:70ms"><div class="rounded-[1.75rem] border-2 border-plum transition-[background-color,box-shadow] duration-300 bg-cream/60 hover:bg-cream hover:shadow-[0_3px_0_0_var(--color-plum)]"><h3><button id="faq-trigger-1" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-1" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="font-heading text-[1.4rem] leading-tight text-plum sm:text-2xl">Can I cancel a monthly plan?</span><span class="grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-plum text-plum transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-butter bg-cream"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-5 transition-transform duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="faq-panel-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-1" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-6 pb-6 leading-relaxed text-plum/80">Yes, anytime, with 30 days&#x27; notice. There are no long contracts and no cancellation fees. We&#x27;d rather keep you because the work is good.</p></div></div></div></li><li class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay:140ms"><div class="rounded-[1.75rem] border-2 border-plum transition-[background-color,box-shadow] duration-300 bg-cream/60 hover:bg-cream hover:shadow-[0_3px_0_0_var(--color-plum)]"><h3><button id="faq-trigger-2" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-2" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="font-heading text-[1.4rem] leading-tight text-plum sm:text-2xl">Do you only work with big brands?</span><span class="grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-plum text-plum transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-butter bg-cream"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-5 transition-transform duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="faq-panel-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-2" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-6 pb-6 leading-relaxed text-plum/80">Not at all. Most of our clients are small and growing businesses, from first-time founders to teams of a few hundred. If you care about doing it properly, we&#x27;re in.</p></div></div></div></li><li class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay:210ms"><div class="rounded-[1.75rem] border-2 border-plum transition-[background-color,box-shadow] duration-300 bg-cream/60 hover:bg-cream hover:shadow-[0_3px_0_0_var(--color-plum)]"><h3><button id="faq-trigger-3" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-3" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="font-heading text-[1.4rem] leading-tight text-plum sm:text-2xl">What do you need from me to get started?</span><span class="grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-plum text-plum transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-butter bg-cream"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-5 transition-transform duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="faq-panel-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-3" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-6 pb-6 leading-relaxed text-plum/80">A 30-minute call, your goals and anything you already have, like a logo, photos or an old website. We handle the rest and tell you exactly when we need your input.</p></div></div></div></li><li class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay:280ms"><div class="rounded-[1.75rem] border-2 border-plum transition-[background-color,box-shadow] duration-300 bg-cream/60 hover:bg-cream hover:shadow-[0_3px_0_0_var(--color-plum)]"><h3><button id="faq-trigger-4" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-4" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="font-heading text-[1.4rem] leading-tight text-plum sm:text-2xl">Do I own the final work?</span><span class="grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-plum text-plum transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-butter bg-cream"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-5 transition-transform duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="faq-panel-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-4" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-6 pb-6 leading-relaxed text-plum/80">Yes. Once the final invoice is paid, every final file and all the rights to it are yours to keep, change and use however you like.</p></div></div></div></li><li class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay:350ms"><div class="rounded-[1.75rem] border-2 border-plum transition-[background-color,box-shadow] duration-300 bg-cream/60 hover:bg-cream hover:shadow-[0_3px_0_0_var(--color-plum)]"><h3><button id="faq-trigger-5" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-5" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="font-heading text-[1.4rem] leading-tight text-plum sm:text-2xl">Can you work with my existing brand or website?</span><span class="grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-plum text-plum transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-butter bg-cream"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-5 transition-transform duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="faq-panel-5" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-5" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-6 pb-6 leading-relaxed text-plum/80">Absolutely. We often refresh or extend what&#x27;s already working rather than starting over, and we&#x27;ll be honest about what to keep and what to change.</p></div></div></div></li><li class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay:420ms"><div class="rounded-[1.75rem] border-2 border-plum transition-[background-color,box-shadow] duration-300 bg-cream/60 hover:bg-cream hover:shadow-[0_3px_0_0_var(--color-plum)]"><h3><button id="faq-trigger-6" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-panel-6" class="group flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-5 text-left"><span class="font-heading text-[1.4rem] leading-tight text-plum sm:text-2xl">Where are you based?</span><span class="grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-plum text-plum transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-butter bg-cream"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-5 transition-transform duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="faq-panel-6" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-trigger-6" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-300 ease-out grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="px-6 pb-6 leading-relaxed text-plum/80">Our studio is in Portland, Oregon, but most of our work happens remotely with clients all over the world. Time zones have never stopped a good project.</p></div></div></div></li></ul></div></section>

<script is:inline>
document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
  const triggers = document.querySelectorAll("#faq button[id^='faq-trigger-']");
  triggers.forEach((btn, idx) => {
    btn.addEventListener("click", () => {
      const panel = document.getElementById("faq-panel-" + idx);
      const isExpanded = btn.getAttribute("aria-expanded") === "true";
      btn.setAttribute("aria-expanded", !isExpanded);
      if (panel) {
        if (isExpanded) {
          panel.setAttribute("hidden", "");
          panel.classList.add("hidden");
        } else {
          panel.removeAttribute("hidden");
          panel.classList.remove("hidden");
        }
      }
    });
  });
});
</script>
